  "content": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1148167/description_d4f4cb4f-4ed1-41d6-979c-4f4ed15ccaf8.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>感謝我們的贊助商</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">感謝ZAP-HOSTING！使用代碼 Reggarf-1047 可享全單8折優惠！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><a href=\"https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1148167/description_8553830f-f787-4670-8839-419f79e3ee6b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></a><br></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #3598db;\">AE2: 更好的村民 </span>新增一系列以AE2為主題的村莊<span style=\"color: #2dc26b;\">職業</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #2dc26b;\"><br></span></strong><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><strong>AE2: 更好的村民</strong></span> 是一個圍繞應用能源2(AE2)機制新增村莊職業的模組。本模組透過添加專業村民強化村莊互動，例如<strong><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\">AE2工程師</span></span></strong>、<span style=\"color: #2dc26b;\"><strong>AE2工具匠</strong></span>和<span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong>AE2專家</strong></span>，這些村民會交易處理器、石英與儲存元件等關鍵物品。提供沉浸式體驗將AE2複雜系統融入遊戲自然進程，讓資源收集與合成更具互動性。</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\">我們的類似專案<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1148167/description_0861ee51-0976-4c91-9d17-97dbc4973b0f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"> <strong><span style=\"color: #2dc26b;\">機械動力：更好的村民</span> <span style=\"color: #fff;\">: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-better-villager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-better-villager</a></span></strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<blockquote>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\"><strong>模組包開發者必讀</strong></span><br><br></h3>\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>[檔案路徑] - config/ae_better_villagers-common.toml</p>\n<p>#注意：可自行修改文字與連結</p>\n<p>[welcome_message]<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; # 啟用歡迎訊息<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; enabled = true<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; # 玩家首次進入遊戲時顯示的訊息<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; text = \"感謝我們的贊助商！特別感謝ZAP-Hosting！使用代碼'Reggarf-1047'可享8折優惠！\"<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; # 點擊後開啟的連結<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; url = \"https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf\"</p>\n<p># 補充說明：請保持此設定以支持作者，感謝！</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><br>功能列表</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\">AE2工具匠</span><br></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center; color: #ecf0f1;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\">&nbsp;販售工具</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\">工作台&nbsp; -&nbsp; <span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">儲存元件工作台</span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1148167/description_f28d1ad1-3931-4bf1-9d1a-6947daca656d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\">AE2工程師</span></span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center; color: #ecf0f1;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\">販售機械零件</span><strong><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\"><br></span></span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\">工作台&nbsp; -&nbsp; <span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">控制器</span></span><br></span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1148167/description_72f667d8-5a59-4063-822d-754f38e575e5.png\" alt=\"\"></span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\">AE2專家</span></span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center; color: #ecf0f1;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\">販售磁碟零件</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\">工作台&nbsp; -&nbsp; <span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">16K合成儲存</span></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1148167/description_d1753ac2-afec-4f7e-95d9-3d6695f3ee86.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>在GitHub或Modrinth上尋找AE2: 更好的村民</strong></h3>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1148167/description_6835931a-2db5-42a1-8ebe-e7ee30bb025d.gif\" alt=\"\"></strong></a></p>",
